/Title (The NIHVA Retractable Roof Panel System is designed to support both Vertical and Horizontal Winding Machine operations by combining a dust-free enclosure, controlled roof opening, safe material handling, and seamless EOT crane accessibility. The Retractable Roof Panel System provides a clean, dust-controlled workspace while enabling automatic roof opening for overhead crane operations. Only the required roof section opens and closes automatically, ensuring efficient handling of winding assemblies, improved workflow, and uninterrupted production.)
